  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under ASC 842-20-30-1, the initial ROU asset equals the present value of lease payments ($446,511) plus any prepayments made at or before commencement and initial direct costs, less lease incentives received. Wrong (B): Using undiscounted payments of $500,000 ignores the time value of money required by ASC 842. Wrong (C): A single year''s payment bears no relationship to the ROU asset measurement under the standard. Wrong (D): The ROU asset is based on the lessee''s payment obligation, not the fair value of the underlying asset.$EXPL$
